cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this evaluation pipeline, its configs, or its results, please
  cite this repository. If you use the MILU benchmark itself, please cite
  the original MILU paper (see references below).
title: >-
  MILU Evaluation of Newer LLMs: a reproducible pipeline and results for
  evaluating large language models on the MILU Indic-language benchmark
